 just hanging on  until the universe eventually blinked  out of existence so that maybe then they  could rest in peace the moral of this  story you can't cheat death because  death isn't the other player it's the  game  itself now go check out secret group  that runs the world scp-05 council  explained and  scp-006 fountain of youth for more  videos about attempts to cheat death and  its not so pleasant consequences

